 ·iRdist+i : ∀ (I J K : CommIdeal) → I ·i (J +i K) ≡ I ·i J +i I ·i K
 ·iRdist+i I J K = CommIdeal≡Char (·iRdist+iLIncl I J K) (·iRdist+iRIncl I J K)

