                 → Cospan (CommAlgebrasCategory R')
   Cospan.l (thePShfCospan (f , Df≡𝔞) (g , Dg≡𝔟)) = BasisStructurePShf .Functor.F-ob (𝔟 , ∣ g , Dg≡𝔟 ∣₁)
