           → isPullback (CommAlgebrasCategory R') (thePShfCospan a b) _ _
                        (BFsq (𝔞 , ∣ a ∣₁) (𝔟 , ∣ b ∣₁) ∣ c ∣₁ BasisStructurePShf)
   Σhelper (f , Df≡𝔞) (g , Dg≡𝔟) (h , Dh≡𝔞∨𝔟) = toSheafPB.lemma
