           (𝔞 , ∣ f , Df≡𝔞 ∣₁)
           (𝔟 , ∣ g , Dg≡𝔟 ∣₁)
           (𝔞 ∧z 𝔟 , basicOpensAreBasis .∧lClosed 𝔞 𝔟 ∣ f , Df≡𝔞 ∣₁ ∣ g , Dg≡𝔟 ∣₁)
